{"posts":[{"id":"homeoffinisher_p8_176","t":"Away\n\nAmbujaCem -- Sector - Industrial Goods (chart still bullish). Stock belongs to cementing industries. and now it's at all time high! taking opposite trades for such bullish stocks is nonsense for herd. but that's how we play here in RTM.\n\nMonthly -- The horizontal line is high of the swing low candle.this swing low candle is reaction to previous CAP on price. Also there is FO to previous low. might be QM, let's drop in weekly.\n\nWeekly -- should we say it as \"hidden flag?\" or the \"ignored one?\". I will like to call is hidden because this levels intentionally left behind by ITs.\n\nDaily Chart 1(bigger picture) -- H2 line marked with arrow is LS. H3 line explained in next chart\n\nDaily Chart 2 (zoomed view) -- H3 line marked currently is low of the swing high candle of Daily TF (TF is lower to the importance of this SR is also less). let's move to H1 chart\n\nH1 -- this is 1 hourly chart. You can clearly see 4D to FL SZ. 4D is big part of Compression, but price didn't dropped swiftly, why? for pending orders? Let's take a look in m5 tf to see what I like to show. and possible opportunity, if any?\n\n5Min -- We have beautiful QM level at LS kink. though this is Right shoulder to our H1 QM level, it holds importance because retailers are told to take entry as soon as price breaks the LL or head and shoulder pattern.So they must be having stops above BSZ after the break of LL of HNS pattern:-)\n\nLet's wait for the result.","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#176","p":8,"im":["67ed0c6b2e0ae81c91e86dbc84dd2e706ef1cb65","f16ee806b8858b13323f19403aad3ca4f745a17b","23a15f1e7627827bbb0b1eebb5a64ff3662e3f88","90719c30c00c12c80f717183bf9ad383a253b91c","1d4f288c7a3ea2b4619894b671d14aa74aaeb6fe","9f28e8228d4b3c0c463d997f29af8a207522e303"],"m":176},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p8_177","t":"Away\n\nKavya wrote: Got some move!\n\nMore updates...","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#177","p":8,"im":["66c06d1d25f2c5dde3ad17c4377e885aabac4b8b","11bf0afe0